<h1 data-copy-en="Pepper" data-copy-zh="Pepper">Pepper</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Find Pepper’s daily staff schedule, personal interactions, crafted training gifts and resort continuation." data-copy-zh="查看Pepper的每日排班、个人互动、手工训练礼物与度假后续。">Find Pepper’s daily staff schedule, personal interactions, crafted training gifts and resort continuation.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">去哪里找</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">卡住时检查什么</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Twenty-Two_Shared_Resort_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Sunset_Walk_with_Pepper"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Sunset_Walk_Heart-to-Heart"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Sirena_Isle_Daily_Activities_and_Sunset_Walk"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Two_Crafted_Training_Upgrades"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Best_Pepper_rewards"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Eleven_Home_and_Shared_Automatic_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Two_Known-Stage_Bedroom_Movies"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Pepper — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/pepper.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Pepper — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/pepper.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Pepper — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Pepper joins the Rose &amp; Thorn staff through the Easter reward. Her home routine includes conversations, gifts, two private actions and shared staff events; later progress continues through training and resort visits.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Home_Schedule.2C_Talk_and_Gifts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Home_Schedule,_Talk_and_Gifts"></span><h2>Where to find them</h2><p>Own Rose &amp; Thorn and redeem the applicable Easter reward code to recruit her. If you redeemed it before acquiring the business, the recruitment can be restored after you own it.</p><p>While active and home from vacation: Master Bedroom 05:00–09:00; The Bar 09:00–15:00; West Hallway 15:00–22:00, daily.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Recruitment_and_Recommended_Route"></span><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Begin with An Easter Offering at the property. Raise affection through Talk and, from Acquaintance (50), Chocolate and Flowers. The three location-specific Talk allowances are separate, five positive talks each per day; the gift allowances are shared across locations.</p><p>Visit the other rooms for the staff scenes below. These use their own hours and participant requirements; Pepper does not need an ordinary portrait there. Check the two participants’ affection for Willow, Brandy, Sophie, Raven and Momosagi encounters.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Automatic scene</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">An Easter Offering</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Rose &amp; Thorn</td><td data-label="Requirements">home from vacation: Pepper; Pepper active as staff</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The New Hire</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Elara's Office</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acknowledged (10); home from vacation: Elara / Pepper; Pepper active as staff</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Bar Training</th><td data-label="Location / start window">The Bar</td><td data-label="Requirements">Known (25); home from vacation: Pepper; Pepper active as staff</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Cooking Lessons</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Kitchen</td><td data-label="Requirements">Known (25); home from vacation: Pepper; Pepper active as staff</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Checkup</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Nurse's Room; 09:00–16:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Known (25); Willow Known (25); home from vacation: Pepper / Willow; Pepper active as staff</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Lessons in Charm</th><td data-label="Location / start window">The Bar; 20:00–23:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acquaintance (50); Brandy Known (25); home from vacation: Brandy / Pepper; Pepper active as staff</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Pet Bunny</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Worker Quarters; 13:00–17:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Known (25); Sophie Known (25); home from vacation: Pepper / Sophie; Pepper / Sophie active as staff</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Pepper’s Raven encounter</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Brothel Dungeon; 18:00–22:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acquaintance (50); Raven Known (25); home from vacation: Pepper / Raven; Pepper active as staff</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Bunny Bonding</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Master Bedroom; 06:00–09:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Known (25); Momosagi Known (25); home from vacation: Momosagi / Pepper; Pepper / Momosagi active as staff</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Spice Incident</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Kitchen; 12:00–17:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Poppy Known (25); Known (25); Brandy Known (25); after A Cheerful Cook Arrives; home from vacation: Brandy / Pepper; Brandy / Pepper active as staff</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A Gentle Soul</th><td data-label="Location / start window">VIP Lounge; 11:00–17:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">after The Grand Opening; home from vacation: Pepper / Vixen; Pepper active as staff</td></tr></tbody></table><p>At In Love (3,000), two specific handmade gifts unlock her permanent training upgrades at the Master Bedroom 05:00–09:00. The table lists the required earlier events and exact gift. Each consumes one gift, takes no time, adds +0.5 base income and doubles experience for its associated training.</p></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Craft_the_Exact_Gifts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Session_Talk.2C_Praise_and_Gifts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Session_Talk,_Praise_and_Gifts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Worker_Visits_and_Eight_Training_Options"></span><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / start window</th><th scope="col">Cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Pepper</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Master Bedroom; Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">15 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+1 base affection; 5/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Chocolate</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Master Bedroom / The Bar / West Hallway; Acquaintance (50)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">10 min; 1 Chocolate</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+5 base affection; 1/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Flowers</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Master Bedroom / The Bar / West Hallway; Acquaintance (50)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">10 min; 1 Flowers</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+8 base affection; 1/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Private Time</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Master Bedroom; Known (25)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">30 min; 60 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+50 base affection; 1/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Bunny Reward</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Master Bedroom; Known (25)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">30 min; 60 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+50 base affection; 1/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Pepper</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">The Bar; Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">15 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+1 base affection; 5/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Pepper</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">West Hallway; Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">15 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+1 base affection; 5/day</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Crafted-gift scene</th><th scope="col">Where / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Cost</th><th scope="col">Training upgraded</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">The Things Pepper Knows</th><td data-label="Where / start window">Master Bedroom; 05:00–09:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">In Love (3000); home from vacation; A Gentle Soul; The New Hire; Cooking Lessons; The Pet Bunny; Checkup</td><td data-label="Cost">0 min; hand in 1 Prismatic Spell Brooch</td><td data-label="Training upgraded">Doggie</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Life Pepper Chose</th><td data-label="Where / start window">Master Bedroom; 05:00–09:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">In Love (3000); home from vacation; Checkup; Sunset Walk with Pepper</td><td data-label="Cost">0 min; hand in 1 Void-Kissed Charm</td><td data-label="Training upgraded">Oral</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The two Known-stage bedroom actions each take 30 minutes and 60 Energy, give 50 base affection and 50 player Erotic Experience, and have independent once-daily allowances. Start them from her morning bedroom portrait.</p><p>Numbered staff visits have their own relationship, training and gift progress. Use the Brothel guide for all eight training types and normal session costs. Ordinary gifts here do not replace a required handcrafted upgrade gift.</p><p>On a resort vacation, daily activities replace her home portrait. Her beach Sunset Walk with Pepper starts 17:00–20:00, takes 60 minutes and can be completed once per day. The shared beach scene The Smallest Bow needs both Pepper and Cinnamon vacationing, 08:00–16:00, after Cinnamon’s A Room to Perform. See the Resort guide for the full shared encounter list.</p><p>While Pepper is present at home, Encourage Pepper takes 20 minutes, gives 1 base affection and +1 Loyalty up to 100, once per day. If the Bar entrance is not yet available, use her other home locations while progressing Brandy’s recruitment.</p><p>Favorite stats are Charm, Stamina, Cooking. Learning Empathy improves the relationship bonus.</p><p>Start times are shown; the ending hour is excluded. Base affection receives the relationship bonuses, while direct affection is added as listed. Ordinary affection, player Erotic Experience and NPC intimacy experience are separate.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Completion_and_Troubleshooting"></span><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><ul><li>After redeeming the reward, check ownership and whether Pepper is active or away on vacation before searching her home rooms.</li><li>The bedroom actions are morning options, even though her afternoon portrait is elsewhere.</li><li>For the training upgrades, bring the named crafted gift and finish the listed route steps; a generic Book, ordinary affection or an upgraded training level does not substitute.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-crystals-and-doomsday.html">Reward codes and access</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-brothel.html">Staff visits, gifts and training</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-sirena-isle-resort.html">Resort activities and shared encounters</a></li><li><a href="character-lillian.html">Lillian</a></li><li><a href="character-vixen.html">Vixen</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Twenty-Two_Shared_Resort_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Sunset_Walk_with_Pepper"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Sunset_Walk_Heart-to-Heart"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Sirena_Isle_Daily_Activities_and_Sunset_Walk"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Two_Crafted_Training_Upgrades"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Best_Pepper_rewards"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Eleven_Home_and_Shared_Automatic_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Two_Known-Stage_Bedroom_Movies"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Pepper 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/pepper.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Pepper 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/pepper.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Pepper 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Pepper通过复活节奖励加入玫瑰与荆棘。她在家中有交谈、礼物、两项私人行动和员工共同事件，之后还可推进训练与度假村活动。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Home_Schedule.2C_Talk_and_Gifts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Home_Schedule,_Talk_and_Gifts"></span><h2>去哪里找</h2><p>拥有玫瑰与荆棘后，兑换对应的复活节奖励码即可招募。若在取得产业之前已经兑换，拥有产业后可恢复尚未完成的招募。</p><p>在职且未度假时，每天的地点为：主卧05:00–09:00，酒吧09:00–15:00，西走廊15:00–22:00。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Recruitment_and_Recommended_Route"></span><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>先在产业触发复活节献礼，再通过交谈推进好感；相识（50好感）起可送巧克力与鲜花。3个地点的交谈额度分别计算，各每天5次；送礼额度则在不同地点之间共用。</p><p>到其他房间触发下表中的员工事件。这些事件按自身时段与参与者条件出现，不要求Pepper的日常头像也排班在那里；与Willow、Brandy、Sophie、Raven及Momosagi的事件需核对双方好感。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">自动事件</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">复活节献礼</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">玫瑰与荆棘</td><td data-label="条件">已结束度假：Pepper；Pepper已启用为员工</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">新员工</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Elara的办公室</td><td data-label="条件">已遇见（10好感）；已结束度假：Elara / Pepper；Pepper已启用为员工</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">吧台训练</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">酒吧</td><td data-label="条件">已知（25好感）；已结束度假：Pepper；Pepper已启用为员工</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">烹饪课</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">厨房</td><td data-label="条件">已知（25好感）；已结束度假：Pepper；Pepper已启用为员工</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">检查</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">护士室；09:00–16:59</td><td data-label="条件">已知（25好感）；Willow 已知（25好感）；已结束度假：Pepper / Willow；Pepper已启用为员工</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">魅力课程</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">酒吧；20:00–23:59</td><td data-label="条件">相识（50好感）；Brandy 已知（25好感）；已结束度假：Brandy / Pepper；Pepper已启用为员工</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">宠物兔兔</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">员工宿舍；13:00–17:59</td><td data-label="条件">已知（25好感）；Sophie 已知（25好感）；已结束度假：Pepper / Sophie；Pepper / Sophie已启用为员工</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Pepper与Raven的事件</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">地牢；18:00–22:59</td><td data-label="条件">相识（50好感）；Raven 已知（25好感）；已结束度假：Pepper / Raven；Pepper已启用为员工</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">兔兔结缘</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">主卧；06:00–09:59</td><td data-label="条件">已知（25好感）；Momosagi 已知（25好感）；已结束度假：Momosagi / Pepper；Pepper / Momosagi已启用为员工</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">香料事件</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">厨房；12:00–17:59</td><td data-label="条件">Poppy 已知（25好感）；已知（25好感）；Brandy 已知（25好感）；完成：开朗厨娘到来；已结束度假：Brandy / Pepper；Brandy / Pepper已启用为员工</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">温柔的灵魂</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">VIP休息室；11:00–17:59</td><td data-label="条件">完成：盛大开业；已结束度假：Pepper / Vixen；Pepper已启用为员工</td></tr></tbody></table><p>恋爱中（3,000好感）后，可在主卧05:00–09:00交付两种指定手工礼物，永久升级相应训练。下表列出所需事件与礼物；每项消耗礼物1件，不耗时间，基础收入+0.5，对应训练经验翻倍。</p></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Craft_the_Exact_Gifts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Session_Talk.2C_Praise_and_Gifts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Session_Talk,_Praise_and_Gifts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Worker_Visits_and_Eight_Training_Options"></span><h2>行动与奖励</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">和 Pepper 交谈</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">主卧；陌生人（0好感）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">15分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+1；每天5次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送巧克力</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">主卧 / 酒吧 / 西走廊；相识（50好感）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">10分钟；巧克力×1</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+5；每天1次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送花</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">主卧 / 酒吧 / 西走廊；相识（50好感）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">10分钟；鲜花×1</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+8；每天1次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">私人时间</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">主卧；已知（25好感）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">30分钟；60精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+50；每天1次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">兔女郎奖励</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">主卧；已知（25好感）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">30分钟；60精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+50；每天1次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">和 Pepper 交谈</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">酒吧；陌生人（0好感）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">15分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+1；每天5次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">和 Pepper 交谈</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">西走廊；陌生人（0好感）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">15分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+1；每天5次</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">手工礼物事件</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">消耗</th><th scope="col">升级训练</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Pepper知道的事</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">主卧；05:00–09:00</td><td data-label="条件">恋爱中（3000好感）；已结束度假；温柔的灵魂；新员工；烹饪课；宠物兔兔；检查</td><td data-label="消耗">0分钟；交付棱彩法术胸针×1</td><td data-label="升级训练">后入式</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Pepper选择的人生</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">主卧；05:00–09:00</td><td data-label="条件">恋爱中（3000好感）；已结束度假；检查；和 Pepper 的日落散步</td><td data-label="消耗">0分钟；交付虚吻护符×1</td><td data-label="升级训练">口交</td></tr></tbody></table><p>两项已知阶段的卧室行动均消耗30分钟、60精力，获得50基础好感与50玩家情趣经验；各自每天一次，从早晨的主卧头像发起。</p><p>员工编号来访另有自己的关系、训练与送礼进度。8种训练及一般来访消耗请看青楼指南；普通礼物不能代替升级所需的指定手工礼物。</p><p>度假时，她的家中头像会改为度假村活动。海滩上的和 Pepper 的日落散步可在17:00–20:00开始，消耗60分钟，每天完成一次。共同海滩事件小小一鞠躬需Pepper和Cinnamon均在度假，并完成Cinnamon的一间属于她的表演室，时间为08:00–16:00。完整共同事件请看度假村指南。</p><p>Pepper在家中当前地点出现时，鼓励 Pepper消耗20分钟，基础好感+1、忠诚度+1（上限100），每天一次。酒吧入口尚未开放时，可先到她的其他排班地点，并推进Brandy招募。</p><p>偏好的属性为魅力、耐力、烹饪。学会共情可提高关系加成。</p><p>表中均为开始时间，不包含结束整点。基础好感受关系加成影响，直接好感按所列数值增加。普通好感、玩家情趣经验和NPC亲密经验分别计算。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Completion_and_Troubleshooting"></span><h2>卡住时检查什么</h2><ul><li>兑换后仍找不到她时，先确认已拥有产业，以及她是否在职或正在度假。</li><li>卧室行动在早晨开放，下午需去其他排班地点。</li><li>训练升级需交付指定手工礼物，并完成所列事件；普通书籍、好感或既有训练等级不能代替。</li></ul></section>
